      "value": "Enderguard Amulet"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This amulet, when worn, will "
        },
        {
          "text": "teleport nearby creepers that are about to explode away from me",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " as long as it has charge remaining.  It can make use of "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Gem Fragments",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " and their upgrades that are in my pack to extend its charge.\n\nHopefully they don't teleport near something else that's friendly.  I'm sure it'll be fine."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
